    Source: C:\Code\WinUI3\WinUIGallery\Samples\ListView\ListViewPage.xaml   – list row template
    Source: C:\Code\WinUI3\WinUIGallery\Samples\StoragePickers\StoragePickersPage.xaml.cs – FolderPicker
